{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/078-da-shu-yu-tian/maruichen-tongshi/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/078-da-shu-yu-tian/maruichen-tongshi/0001-1/data.json","title":"毛詩傳箋通釋 · 叔于田，乘乘馬。執轡如組，兩驂如舞。叔在藪，火烈具舉。襢裼暴虎，獻于公所。將叔無狃，戒其傷女。叔于田，乘乘黃。兩服上襄，兩驂鴈行。叔在藪，火烈具揚。叔善射忌，又良御忌。抑磬控忌，抑縱送忌。叔于田，乘乘鴇。兩服齊首，兩驂如手。叔在藪，火烈具阜。叔馬慢忌，叔發罕忌。抑釋掤忌，抑鬯弓忌。 · 马瑞辰 · 通释","description":"風 · 鄭風 · 大叔于田 · 《毛詩傳箋通釋》关于“叔于田，乘乘馬。執轡如組，兩驂如舞。叔在藪，火烈…”的注脚：馬瑞辰仍據《序》釋《大叔于田》為刺莊公縱弟之詩，謂此篇較前篇更實寫叔段從獵矜勇、暴虎獻公之狀，而「將叔無狃，戒其傷女」更反見莊公姑息縱成其驕。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"078-da-shu-yu-tian","materialId":"maruichen-tongshi","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/078-da-shu-yu-tian/maruichen-tongshi/0001-1","poem":{"id":"078-da-shu-yu-tian","title":"大叔于田","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhengfeng","path":["風","鄭風","大叔于田"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"叔于田","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"乘乘馬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"執轡如組","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"兩驂如舞","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"叔在藪","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"火烈具舉","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"襢裼暴虎","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"獻于公所","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"將叔無狃","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"戒其傷女","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"叔于田","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"乘乘黃","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"兩服上襄","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"兩驂鴈行","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"叔在藪","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"火烈具揚","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"叔善射忌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"又良御忌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"抑磬控忌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"抑縱送忌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"叔于田","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-022","text":"乘乘鴇","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-023","text":"兩服齊首","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-024","text":"兩驂如手","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-025","text":"叔在藪","isActive":true},{